From 4c80d9a6ace83369dabce6261479f2044e7dcb9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:40:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 04/18] Round 4: Record traces as typed, preallocated day rows

Traced catchment and reservoir days become typed structs in a vector
preallocated to the number of simulated days, replacing one json! map
with six string keys per day. Fields stay in sorted key order, so the
trace JSON text is unchanged. The reservoir input row type is renamed
ReservoirInput to free the name for the traced day.

Workload: trace (12 traced full records of 90 days), 11 samples
against round 3.
Before median: 1.183 ms. After median: 0.414 ms. Speedup: 2.85x.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
